{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"56ba90c9d7064fee649c5767e9aa5588e8a405a3d88a9d599d489ea77e228900","occurred_at":"2026-11-21T19:34:55Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"failure_class":"evidence","mapped_intervals":[[99,102]],"mapped_path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-live-binding.py","quoted_text":"DEPENDENCY_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"(?P<directive>Wants|Requires|Requisite|BindsTo|PartOf|Conflicts|\"\n    r\"WantedBy|RequiredBy|Also|Upholds|OnFailure|OnSuccess|Triggers|\"\n    r\"TriggersBy|Unit|Service)\\s*=\\s*(?P<value>.*)\")","reason":"The dependency scan's directive list omits systemd v257 `PropagatesStopTo=` and `StopPropagatedFrom=`. A co-installed unit such as `backup.service` can therefore stop the selected crq unit without discovery detecting the dependency, allowing it to report `supported=True`. This is an implementation gap in the existing dependency scan, and adding both directives to `DEPENDENCY_RE` is the smallest compatible fix.","target":"7a88f3087e17a77a01e1c5f4628c542ef8ead5d3"},"finding_id":"1d6d3a879edaf2afe7e9a329fb5916c084c5d2f4f230f484983ff91ea4a44881","previous_event_id":"230afab6475c60d407a78645fb59c7d88673439b98f670822b2fcc987ab9043c","review_id":"9a9770d007f4898ae9f169624c7b761856e1e349d118670986a85a8250d506cd"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:1d6d3a879edaf2afe7e9a329fb5916c084c5d2f4f230f484983ff91ea4a44881:52557e7948b0be03a2f95ceb0904bf8ae9b21c240df95bd1026025ac4fcef331"}